{"id":"01654ea94d536354","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-order11-rank-function-on-wellorder.md","title":"ZFC Order11 Rank Function On Wellorder","display":"df-zfc-order11-rank-function-on-wellorder — ZFC Order11 Rank Function On Wellorder","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order11-rank-function-on-wellorder","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order11-rank-function-on-wellorder"],"display":"df-zfc-order11-rank-function-on-wellorder — ZFC Order11 Rank Function On Wellorder","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-order-type.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order11-rank-function-on-wellorder"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order11-rank-function-on-wellorder</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order11-rank-function-on-wellorder — ZFC Order11 Rank Function On Wellorder"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" href=\"?note=5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-order-type.md\">../batch11/58-df-order-type.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,W,\\rho\\in V\">\\(X,W,\\rho\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(W\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^W_{&lt;x}:=\\{y\\in X\\mid\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in W\\}\">\\(X^W_{&lt;x}:=\\{y\\in X\\mid\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in W\\}\\)</span> (strict predecessor set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\upharpoonright X^W_{&lt;x}:=W\\cap(X^W_{&lt;x}\\times X^W_{&lt;x})\">\\(W\\upharpoonright X^W_{&lt;x}:=W\\cap(X^W_{&lt;x}\\times X^W_{&lt;x})\\)</span> (restricted relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\alpha,X,W)\">\\(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\alpha,X,W)\\)</span> (the order-type predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,X,\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,X,\\alpha)\\)</span> (function predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11RankFunctionOnWellorder}_S(\\rho,W,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11RankFunctionOnWellorder}_S(\\rho,W,X)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}rank\\text{-}function\\text{-}on\\text{-}wellorder} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder11RankFunctionOnWellorder}_S(\\rho,W,X)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\alpha,X,W)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,X,\\alpha)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\beta,X^W_{&lt;x},W\\upharpoonright X^W_{&lt;x})\\land\\rho(x)=\\beta\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}rank\\text{-}function\\text{-}on\\text{-}wellorder} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder11RankFunctionOnWellorder}_S(\\rho,W,X)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\alpha,X,W)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,X,\\alpha)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\beta,X^W_{&lt;x},W\\upharpoonright X^W_{&lt;x})\\land\\rho(x)=\\beta\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The rank of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> is the unique order type of the induced well-order on its strict predecessors. Both the global and local order types are expressed through the canonical three-place predicate, so no undefined <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{otp}\">\\(\\operatorname{otp}\\)</span> term or reversed well-order arguments remain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-order-type.md","status":"resolved","id":"5d2cd56a38a81b7a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-order-type.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,W,\\rho\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"W\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"X^W_{<x}:=\\{y\\in X\\mid\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in W\\}","display":false},{"tex":"W\\upharpoonright X^W_{<x}:=W\\cap(X^W_{<x}\\times X^W_{<x})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\alpha,X,W)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,X,\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11RankFunctionOnWellorder}_S(\\rho,W,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}rank\\text{-}function\\text{-}on\\text{-}wellorder} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder11RankFunctionOnWellorder}_S(\\rho,W,X)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\alpha,X,W)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,X,\\alpha)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\beta,X^W_{<x},W\\upharpoonright X^W_{<x})\\land\\rho(x)=\\beta\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{otp}","display":false}],"bytes":1590,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2899","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-order11-rank-function-on-wellorder.md|58-df-zfc-order11-rank-function-on-wellorder]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["5d2cd56a38a81b7a","36d7463d215be751"]}